class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math>-cell by edge bending. Red edges did not change, blue edges have been bent. (e): prismatic tiling by soft <math id="S5.F7.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math>-cells.</figcaption>
